# The Shadower's fourth class node and the longest attack they have: ten slashes
# over five and a quarter seconds from one press.
#
# GMS's own figures, and the client's timing too. Nine allies appear for
# 705+28x% eleven times across six enemies, spaced 900, 780, 660, 480, 360, 240,
# 180 and 120ms apart by the client: a formation closing in, not a steady drip.
# Then at 4170ms the leader lands for 790+30x% fifteen times across eight, eight
# slashes 30ms apart. Every hit ignores defense completely: GMS states one
# ignoreMobpdpR of 100 for the whole skill.
#
# The nine land together instead of spaced out with cast_interval_ms. Two things
# rule spacing out, both because of the two-minute cooldown. An extra hit comes
# with every strike of a spaced swing, so the leader would land nine times; and
# BarrageStrikes prices a beat longer than the press at the rate it can sustain,
# which for a 120ms press and a 3.7-second beat is 0.29 of a strike. That rule
# is for swings limited by how fast they can be used again, and this one is
# limited by its cooldown. So the nine land together, and the log shows them as
# GMS's nine landings of eleven.
#
# The leader is an extra hit with its own crowd, so it is counted separately on
# the eight it reaches instead of merged into the six. Its eight slashes are
# 30ms apart, the same moment either way.
#
# The cast is 600ms of frames that GMS skips entirely while Assassinate or Cruel
# Stab is running, which for a Shadower is always: the client's actionList names
# both, and they are the two swings the player uses. So the animation is
# recorded, and the press is what it costs (see waives_cast).
#
# Dropped: the 1200 MP, immunity to attack reflection, and the second press that
# calls the leader in early.
name: "Slash Shadow Formation"
description:
  "Team up with dark allies in a special formation to perform a joint attack. "
  "Unaffected by the effects of Shadow Partner."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SHADOWER_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_DAGGER
base_delay_ms: 600
waives_cast: true
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
max_enemies: 6
lines: 11
casts: 9
skips_mirror: true
base {
  skill_pct: 7.33
  ied_pct: 1.00
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.28 }
extra_hit {
  label: "Leader's Slash"
  max_enemies: 8
  lines: 15
  casts: 8
  base { skill_pct: 8.20 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.30 }
}
